on message says \"loop bindings\" also for function-level targets (cosmetic; target records its kind) | slice 4 review (glm session 5ff7ec63, verified against compile-loop/clojure.cljc:879-955 and ast_walker.cljc zero :tail? references) | yang.clojure | slice 5 (all three: one pre-pass rides the outcome-channel work) | P3 |\n558:| yang.clojure: the and/or if-chain expansions bind host gensym names (and__/or__) outside the dsg__ reserved-prefix regime that slice 5 hardens; a colliding user-typed and__<n> would shadow inside the expansion; closing route: reserved-prefix names bound through the internal let | slice 5 review (glm session in collab/1793242637826; pre-existing at a34a2251) | yang.clojure | slice 6 (same expansion family) | P3 |\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/safepoint.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude_module.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/scope.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/quoted.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/builtins.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/publication.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude_p9.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/demo_packets.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/cst.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/safepoint.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/uast.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/render.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/siteset.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/scope.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/repl.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/repl_probe.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/publication.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/safepoint.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/render.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelude.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/scope.cljc\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/lower.cljc\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The port brief’s “no retention object needed” claim needs correction: a continuation carries a condition to a catch, but R3 also requires a saved exception rethrown later to recover that condition. I’ll trace that path and check the macro lane before ruling on whether the reserved doors are inaccessible to guest code."}}
